WEBVTT

00:00:00.496 --> 00:00:01.220
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.133 --> 00:00:04.113
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> We <b>often</b> go out on Friday night.

00:00:05.261 --> 00:00:08.149
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> She doesn’t <b>usually</b> study at weekends.

00:00:09.155 --> 00:00:10.211
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I’m <b>never</b> ill.

00:00:11.312 --> 00:00:13.258
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> He’s <b>always</b> late for work.

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:15.972
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:17.013 --> 00:00:19.032
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> She gets up early <b>every day</b>.

00:00:20.123 --> 00:00:22.667
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> We have English classes <b>twice a week</b>.